    "clusters_limitation": "Topic clustering runs asynchronously in Braintrust's product UI over already-synced traces; this SDK/REST surface exposes no read-back of materialized cluster names within a single script invocation. The facet function above is created for real (confirmed live); cluster names are read back and appended here once a topic map exists, not invented in the meantime.",
